<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-hŏnōrus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>without honor</i>, <i>not
				respected</i> or <i>esteemed</i>, <i>of no account</i>, <i>inconsiderable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civitates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 30, 33, § 126</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pomum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					15, 24, 28, § 99</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hercules,</span>”
				<i>to whom no divine honors are paid</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 5, 5, § 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">signa,</span>”
				<i>disfigured</i>, <i>defaced</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 62</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Unsightly</i>, <i>ugly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">facies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					10, 391</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭnhŏnōrē</span></b> , <i>dishonorably</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contemni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 3, 53</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">6, 18</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
